  title="Identity and access"
  description="Parents use Entra External ID, administrators use a workforce app role, and each house authenticates to the API with its own device key."
>
  <p class="lede">Parents, invited adolescents, administrators and home hubs reach separate route groups in one API application. Parents and adolescents share Entra External ID authentication but have different application permissions. Administrators use workforce tokens with the <code>Lanternina.Admin</code> role. Each hub presents a key bound to its household.</p>

